    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d220-a1">

                <pb facs="0305" n="225" xml:id="pg225"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Lord Lansdowne to Mr.
                            Choate.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-06-19"><hi rendition="#italic">June 19,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your excellency’s note of the 13th instant and to inform you that His
                    Majesty’s consul at the Azores had already reported for the sanction of His
                    Majesty’s Government the arrangement by which his duties will be performed
                    during his absence by the consul of the United States.</p>
                <p>I have to request your excellency to convey to the United States Government the
                    thanks of His Majesty’s Government for their courtesy in this matter.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansdowne.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
